The appellant is accordingly sentenced to the imprisonment
for a term of 10 years and to pay a fine in the sum of Rs.10,000/-. The appellant has already undergone imprisonment for a longer term. Thus, the appellant may be released immediately. The appeal stands disposed of accordingly. (NEETA SAPRA) (BEENA JOLLY)
COURT MASTER (SH) COURT MASTER (NSH)
